WEBVTT

00:12:57.716 --> 00:13:00.452
Waxaan rajeynayaa maalin uun in aan ku arko.

00:13:00.452 --> 00:13:03.788
Hooyadey ma u diri karaa fa.riin yar?

00:13:03.788 --> 00:13:05.439
Haa, Hubaal.

00:13:05.439 --> 00:13:08.228
Wax badan wakhti maanan kula qaadanin.

00:13:08.228 --> 00:13:10.140
Waan ogahay weli in aad i jeceshahay.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.084
Weli waad ii duceysaa.

00:13:13.084 --> 00:13:16.204
Waadna iga fekertaa.

00:13:16.204 --> 00:13:18.356
Waxaan rabaa oo kaliya in aan ku dhaho waad mahadsan tahay.

00:13:18.356 --> 00:13:21.890
In aad ii ogolaato in aan adduunka imaado.

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:23.359
Waad mahadsan tahay.

00:13:23.359 --> 00:13:28.683
(Sacabis)